From 426ae89f3d7bd2a8b271d3ca0eb8952724eb965c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 21:11:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] reaper nav phase 1 v2: shell architecture replaces overlay
 (which broke stock geometry)

reaper_shell.asp: app frame with dashboard-identical topbar+rail (menuTree.js-driven), stock pages load unmodified into an iframe (all settings preserved by construction; same pattern as ASUS webWrapper business UI); hash-based page routing, shell-owned Reboot/Logout. reaper/reaper_content.css loads inside framed pages: strips stock banner/menu/footer + geometry, rethemes tabs/panels/tables/inputs/buttons/log viewer to the reaper palette. Six R_ pilots regenerated with the content css include; overlay reaper_nav.css/js deleted.
